</div>
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">A Style-Based Generator Architecture for Generative Adversarial Networks</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Tero Karras
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>NVIDIA
</span>
